ough .19; 63-705.12(a) through (f); 63-706.131, .132, .3, .421 and .422; 63-801.111, .112, .132, .431, .441, .441(c), .442, .722, .733, .734, .82, .821, .822, .841, .842, .851, .86 and .92; 63-802.15, .151 and .152; 63-804.62, .621, .622, .623, .641 and .642, .642(c), (e) and (f); 63-805.21 and .22; and 63-900.81 and .82.
