	<h2>63-045       IMPLEMENTATION OF STATEWIDE FINGERPRINT IMAGING SYSTEM (SFIS) REGULATIONS</h2>
	<p>
	</p>
	<p>.1      The regulations contained in Sections 63-102f.(3) and s.(12); Section 63-201.31; Sections 63-505.122, .14 and .141; 63-601.12 through .127, and Section 63-602.23 are effective July 1, 1998.  Each county will implement the SFIS in their county when the SFIS equipment is operational county-
	</p>
	<p style="margin-left:27.0pt;">
	</p>
	<p>.11    Upon implementation of the SFIS in each county, the regulations shall be applicable for all new applicants in that county.
	</p>
	<p>
	</p>
	<p>.12    The regulations shall be applied to all continuing cases in each county within twelve months of the installation and operation of the SFIS equipment within that county.
	</p>
