	<h2>63-090       IMPLEMENTATION OF CATEGORICAL ELIGIBILITY - FINAL PROVISIONS</h2>
	<p>
	</p>
	<p>Effective September 1, 1990, the CWDs shall implement the amended provisions in Sections 63-301.631, .632, .724, .73, .74; 63-801.2, .21, .22, .312; and 63-802.12 for all new food stamp applications and continuing cases.
	</p>
	<p>
